# Paths the Tauri dev watcher must ignore. The watcher covers the whole repo
# (rdm-gui depends on the engine crate at the root via a path dependency), so
# without this it rebuilds the Rust app whenever Vite touches node_modules/.vite
# or dist — turning one launch into several needless recompiles.
node_modules
dist
target
.ai-cache
*.log
# Per-download sidecars the engine may write under the project during testing.
*.part
*.rdm
